Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nodejs (>= 20)
Description: Shareable Knip configuration rules for finding unused files, dependencies, and exports
 @sebastienrousseau/knip-config is a shareable configuration preset with no runtime
 dependencies: inert data plus a loader.
 .
 Installed under /usr/share/nodejs so that require() resolves it without
 further configuration.
